  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">PIMS 10313- PPG GEMINI Mexico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The objective of the GEF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full project: GEMINI Mexico. As described in the project concept (PIF/child project concept note), this project aims to promote the production and supply of mercury-free non-ferrous metals (aluminum, copper, lead, zinc), while disseminating knowledge to facilitate the transition to safe mercury-free alternatives and responsible practices in the non-ferrous metals production industry.</narrative>
  </description>
